      "content": "Aliya is 3 years old.\n\nShawna is three times Aliya’s age:\n\n\\[\n3 \\times 3 = 9\n\\]\n\nShawna’s father is five times Shawna’s age:\n\n\\[\n5 \\times 9 = 45\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{45\\text{ years old}}\n\\]",
